---
description: Decide field-level findings for prepareDeliberation.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Produce accessible comparisons, maps or structured location views, and clear decision procedures. Preserve proposer corrections, record the authorized community decision, and transfer selected projects into accountable delivery plans with explicit acceptance criteria. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
